WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:01.102
- You can't see my face

00:00:01.102 --> 00:00:03.069
but my eyes are like this big right now.

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:06.569
(strong empowering music)

00:00:25.196 --> 00:00:27.216
- One of my colleagues flagged a story

00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:30.810
about this American
fencer who was going to be

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.999
the first American athlete to represent

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.268
at the Olympics in hijab.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.735
And then I started to learn
more about Ibtihaj Muhammad.

00:00:37.735 --> 00:00:39.774
I just became really fascinated with her.

00:00:39.774 --> 00:00:41.987
Ibtihaj tweets a lot

00:00:41.987 --> 00:00:44.244
both about her athletic accomplishments

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:48.522
but also casual instances of islamophobia.

00:00:48.522 --> 00:00:50.214
One of the most notable ones

00:00:50.214 --> 00:00:51.926
was when she was side
by South by Southwest

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:53.179
in Austin Texas.

00:00:53.179 --> 00:00:55.479
When she went to go
register and get a badge

00:00:55.479 --> 00:00:57.602
she was told that in
order to take a photo

00:00:57.602 --> 00:01:00.185
she needed to remove her hijab.

00:01:01.414 --> 00:01:02.977
That's pretty ridiculous.

00:01:02.977 --> 00:01:06.120
That was a really telling experience that

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:09.819
millions of Muslims around
the country have experienced.

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:11.838
So recently I was
invited to an event

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:15.359
in which Ibtihaj Muhammad
this incredible fencer

00:01:15.359 --> 00:01:17.347
that I've been following
for the past four months

00:01:17.347 --> 00:01:19.727
was going to teach me how to fence.

00:01:19.727 --> 00:01:21.072
You really could poke out an eye.

00:01:21.072 --> 00:01:23.926
I suspect that fencing is going to be this

00:01:23.926 --> 00:01:25.924
really interesting combination of

00:01:25.924 --> 00:01:29.412
like yoga and ballet
but also mortal combat.

00:01:29.412 --> 00:01:31.472
- We're going to do a short fencing demo.

00:01:31.472 --> 00:01:32.680
(people clapping)

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.350
- we actually have to
change in a locker room.

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:36.964
I thought I could just throw
this stuff on over my clothes.

00:01:36.964 --> 00:01:38.257
Here we go.

00:01:38.257 --> 00:01:40.590
Putting on the fencing gear.

00:01:55.132 --> 00:01:56.131
You can't see my face

00:01:56.131 --> 00:01:59.676
but my eyes are like this big right now.

00:01:59.676 --> 00:02:01.263
- The target area is from the waist up

00:02:01.263 --> 00:02:05.037
and we use slashing motions
to score our points.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:07.822
It's almost like modern
day Zorro, right?

00:02:07.822 --> 00:02:08.728
- Ready?

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:12.147
(hard rock guitar music)

00:02:18.819 --> 00:02:21.819
You want to out-think your opponent.

00:02:23.806 --> 00:02:25.492
This is a lifetime dream of mine

00:02:25.492 --> 00:02:27.997
so to have it finally come true

00:02:27.997 --> 00:02:31.010
was just probably the best
moment in my life, honestly.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.009
I wanted team USA to be as diverse as

00:02:34.009 --> 00:02:35.341
the community I grew up in

00:02:35.341 --> 00:02:36.713
or the America that I know.

00:02:36.713 --> 00:02:38.831
The Muslim community
has always been really

00:02:38.831 --> 00:02:41.066
supportive of me even before
I qualified for the team.

00:02:41.066 --> 00:02:42.824
Now that I'm able to be, you know,

00:02:42.824 --> 00:02:44.120
the speaking voice for my community,

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:47.072
I think that it will move, you know,

00:02:47.072 --> 00:02:50.352
the perception of Muslims
in a positive way.

00:02:50.352 --> 00:02:51.185
- Wow!

00:02:51.185 --> 00:02:53.820
Talking to Ibtihaj, finally
being able to meet her,

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.013
it was really awesome.

00:02:55.013 --> 00:02:57.223
- I really like Drake,
love Rihanna's new album.

00:02:57.223 --> 00:02:59.247
- She's a Drake and Rihanna fan,

00:02:59.247 --> 00:03:01.596
which is really really good to know.

00:03:01.596 --> 00:03:02.607
And I think she's gonna do

00:03:02.607 --> 00:03:04.051
some great things in the Olympics.

00:03:04.051 --> 00:03:05.931
Can we take a quick, like,
two second selfie?

00:03:05.931 --> 00:03:06.764
- Yeah.

00:03:08.131 --> 00:03:10.214
Filter it so I look cute.

